                      {
                        "type": 8,
                        "value": "PyLON EXTRAKTING/recykling:\nI see them wanduring in the nite. Soldiurs marching thru mountains of twice-dead bugz, artificed metallik giants tearing down the pylons that once held our cities togethur. Then, as the old king's corpse rises, they take the   "
